('conflict.v0190.sindri_eitri','being.norse.eitri','norse.sindri_eitri.name','claim.v0190.eitri_reading','claim.v0190.sindri_reading','MANUSCRIPT_NAME_VARIANT','OPEN','Eitri and Sindri participate in a manuscript/edition naming problem for Brokkr’s smith-brother.','Keep two entities until readings in GKS 2367, DG 11 and AM 242 are collated folio by folio.');

